      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LWK are delighted to present No. 42 Hollywoodrath Drive to the market, a superbly appointed and stylish home ideally located in the ever-popular Hollystown, Dublin 15. This impressive property offers a perfect blend of modern design, generous living space, and everyday practicality, making it an ideal choice for families and  alike.\r\n\r\nOn arrival, you are welcomed by a bright and inviting entrance hallway that immediately sets the tone for the quality found throughout. The home boasts a well-balanced layout, designed to maximise natural light and create a sense of space throughout.\r\n\r\nTo the front, a spacious living room provides a comfortable and elegant setting for both relaxing and entertaining. Large windows allow natural light to pour in, enhancing the warm and welcoming atmosphere. To the rear, the property opens into a contemporary kitchen and dining area, thoughtfully designed with a stylish island, integrated appliances, and ample storage. This open-plan space is perfect for modern family life and social gatherings. A separate utility room adds further convenience, while a guest WC completes the ground floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises four generously sized bedrooms, all offering excellent storage options. The master bedroom features a sleek en-suite bathroom, providing a calm and private retreat.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property continues to impress with a west-facing rear garden, ideal for outdoor dining and enjoying sunny days. To the front, there is off-street parking for two vehicles, ensuring practicality for modern living.\r\n\r\nSituated in a quiet and well-established residential area, No. 42 Hollywoodrath Drive benefits from close proximity to a wide range of local amenities, including shops,\r\nschools, parks, and leisure facilities. The area is well-served by transport links, with easy access to Dublin City Centre, the M50 motorway, and Dublin Airport.\r\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a turnkey home in a highly sought-after location.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
